![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

The manual pagination logic is problematic because the Cloudflare API's result_info object does not typically include a next_page field. Furthermore, the SDK's getNextPage() method is designed to return null when no further pages are available. To be more robust against various falsy values when handling external API objects, use an explicit check like page != null && typeof page === "object" instead of a simple truthiness check.

```suggestion
while (page != null && typeof page === "object") {
  // process page.result
  page = await page.getNextPage();
}
```

